cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript listed under preferred-citation."
title: "Analysis code for: Compartmental resolution of matrix-remodelling and proliferation programmes in osteosarcoma"
abstract: >-
  Script-based analysis pipeline covering differential expression and WGCNA candidate-pool
  construction, STRING/cytoHubba hub screening, single-cell compartmental localisation with
  inferCNV malignancy calling, CellChat communication analysis, parallel dual-gene
  scTenifoldKnk in silico knockout, and construction and external validation of a 14-gene
  LASSO-Cox event-free survival signature.
